    },
    "message": "Move the resource ledger and its operations to Rust\n\nresource_ledger_v1 becomes a typed row. An operation writes it in place, so\nthe replacement of the whole namespace at each operation is gone from the\ntick; the Python rule keeps that form as the comparison base and for what the\nkernel refuses. The kernels are the operation, the KPI columns, the check of a\ntick and the lookup of a used reservation ID. The replay of a save stays in\nPython.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
